<aside class="app-aside" aria-label="Wallpaper Search information">
  <form class="aside-search" action="/search" method="get">
    <label class="aside-search-field">
      <i data-lucide="search" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <span class="sr-only">Search wallpapers</span>
      <input type="search" name="searchtext" placeholder="Search Wallpaper Engine" autocomplete="off">
    </label>
    <input type="hidden" name="requiredtags" value="Everyone">
    <input type="hidden" name="requiredtype" value="">
    <input type="hidden" name="p" value="1">
    <input type="hidden" name="browsesort" value="textsearch">
  </form>

  <section class="aside-panel">
    <h2>Workshop search</h2>
    <p>Browse Wallpaper Engine Workshop items and open their SteamCMD download details.</p>
    <a class="aside-action" href="/invite-code">
      Mature access
      <i data-lucide="arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="aside-panel aside-note">
    <h2>Safety note</h2>
    <p>Application and Web wallpapers can contain executable or remote content. Inspect unfamiliar items before opening them.</p>
  </section>

  <footer class="aside-footer">
    <span>&copy; 2026 Wallpaper Search</span>
    <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/431960/workshop/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam Workshop</a>
  </footer>
</aside>
